sequenceDiagram
  participant APS as APScheduler
  participant Sched as scheduler._run_nvd_incremental_sync
  participant Lock as _nvd_lock
  participant NVD as feeds/nvd.fetch_nvd_cve_updates
  participant DB as database.upsert_cves
  participant Ext as feeds/extended.enrich_cves_extended
  participant T as cves + sync_state

  APS->>Sched: interval trigger (default every 1h)
  Sched->>Lock: acquire (skip if locked)
  Sched->>T: resolve_nvd_sync_watermark
  Sched->>NVD: fetch with watermark or days_back window
  NVD-->>Sched: CVE list + new watermark
  Sched->>DB: upsert_cves (cap MAX_CVES_PER_FETCH)
  DB->>T: ON CONFLICT UPDATE + change_history
  Sched->>DB: set_nvd_sync_watermark
  Sched->>Ext: enrich_cves_extended (Sploitus, CIRCL)
  Sched->>T: commit
  Note over Sched: On failure watermark not advanced;<br/>re-run is idempotent via upsert
